   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IJR 2009-2011</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IJR 2009-2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IJR, based in Cape Town, South Africa, is a prominent authority on    issues of transitional justice and reconciliation, working in         selected areas across Africa. Sida&apos;s support to IJR was evaluated     during 2008. Since the conclusions of the evaluation on the whole     have been very positive, Sida decided to provide continued core       support.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IJR, baserat i Kapstaden, Sydafrika, &#xe4;r en framtr&#xe4;dande auktoritet    inom omr&#xe5;det r&#xe4;ttsv&#xe4;sende och f&#xf6;rsoning, och arbetar inom utvalda     omr&#xe5;den i Afrika. Sidas st&#xf6;d till IJR utv&#xe4;rderades under 2008.        Eftersom slutsatserna fr&#xe5;n utv&#xe4;rderingen generellt sett var positiva  har Sida beslutat om fortsatt st&#xf6;d till organisationen.</narrative>
  </description>
